/*!
\page page_stEmcRawHit StEmcRawHit

\brief Raw ADC hit in a single cell of one STAR EMC sub-detector.

\section emcrawhit_overview Overview

StEmcRawHit stores the raw digitised signal from a single readout cell of the
STAR Electromagnetic Calorimeter.  Each hit identifies the cell by a packed
integer (\c mId) encoding the sub-detector, module, η-bin, and φ sub-division,
together with the raw ADC count and the calibrated energy in GeV.

The class is used for all eight EMC sub-detectors (BEMC/EEMC towers,
pre-showers, and SMD strips):

| Sub-detector | StDetectorId |
|---|---|
| BEMC Tower | kBarrelEmcTowerId |
| BEMC Pre-shower | kBarrelEmcPreShowerId |
| BEMC SMD-η | kBarrelSmdEtaStripId |
| BEMC SMD-φ | kBarrelSmdPhiStripId |
| EEMC Tower | kEndcapEmcTowerId |
| EEMC Pre-shower | kEndcapEmcPreShowerId |
| EEMC SMD-U | kEndcapSmdUStripId |
| EEMC SMD-V | kEndcapSmdVStripId |

\section emcrawhit_hierarchy Class Hierarchy

\code
TObject → StObject → StEmcRawHit
\endcode

Instances are owned by \ref page_stEmcModule "StEmcModule" and accessed via
\c StEmcDetector → \c StEmcModule → \c StEmcRawHit.

\section emcrawhit_members Data Members

| Type | Name | Description |
|---|---|---|
| UInt_t | mId | Packed cell address: bits 31–24 calibration type, 23–20 detector offset, 19–13 module, 12–4 eta-bin, 3–0 sub. |
| UInt_t | mAdc | Raw ADC count from the readout electronics. |
| Float_t | mEnergy | Calibrated energy deposit [GeV]. |
| StEmcGeom* | mGeom | Shared EMC geometry singleton (static). |

\section emcrawhit_methods Key Methods

- \c detector() — return the StDetectorId for this hit.
- \c module() — module number (bits 19–13).
- \c eta() — η-bin index within the module (bits 12–4).
- \c sub() — φ sub-division index; returns 1 for SMD strips.
- \c softId(int det) — convert to the software ID used by StEmcGeom.
- \c modEtaSub(int&,int&,int&) — unpack all three address fields.
- \c adc() — raw ADC count.
- \c energy() — calibrated energy [GeV].
- \c calibrationType() — calibration-type flag (bits 31–24).
- \c setId(), \c setAdc(), \c setEnergy() — setters.
- \c Print() — print summary to stdout.

\section emcrawhit_seealso See Also

\ref page_stEmcModule "StEmcModule",
\ref page_stEmcDetector "StEmcDetector",
\ref page_stEmcCluster "StEmcCluster"
*/
